<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Capral year net profit slumps.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Capral year net profit slumps.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 57.49 vs 107.87</p>
<p>    Net				  29.42 vs  60.32</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	  6.0  vs  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Capral Aluminium Ltd is an aluminium producer, formerly known as Alcan Australia Ltd. Company also announced a fully franked special dividend of 25 cents.</p>
</text>
